## 1. Quick Start (Local Development)

```bash
# 1. Copy environment template
cp .env.example .env

# 2. Start container stack
docker compose up -d

# 3. View logs
docker compose logs -f
```

Stack will be available at `http://localhost:{{ service_http_port }}`.

