## 3. Production Deployment (HSL)

This stack is deployed via `homelab-ops` Ansible automation. In production:
* Container images are pulled from registry (`{{ image_registry_namespace }}`).
* Runtime secrets and environment variables are injected into `/opt/homelab/prod/compose/{{ stack_name }}/.env` from Ansible Vault.
* Persistent state is mounted from `/opt/homelab/prod/data/{{ stack_name }}/`.
